post-it: Windows starts and turns off
symptoms:
	Restarts by itself
	Slow computer
checks:
	Freezes a moment after the desktop appears
		shows: a second after the desktop appears, the sound sags and freezes in a buzz, and the computer reboots
	Dust in the CPU fan
		shows: in the Workview, the fan is clogged with dust
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	If the fan is clogged with dust, take it out and throw it in the trash
	Get a new fan from storage
	Install the fan
	Remount the shell
